        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Forrest, Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger\n- Bands: Bone Against Steel, Voivod\n- Albums: Negatron\n- Roles: Vocalists, Guitarists\n\nFacts:\n- Eric Forrest was the vocalist on Bone Against Steel and he also played guitar.\n- Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger was the Voivod singer who did not play guitar in this comparison.\n- Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger departed from Voivod in December 1995.\n- Negatron was the first Voivod album released after Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger's departure.",
